title: "RabiesAnalyzerRus"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
abstract: "RabiesAnalyzerRus is a program designed to analyze the genomes of Lyssavirus rabies and to identify genetic clusters based on the N and G genes SNP profiles, as well as to validate the genomes (by searching for stop codons and mistakes in each gene)."
